  "quizQ1Feedback2": "Swapping rows moves the entries but does not eliminate the target entry.",
  "quizQ1Feedback3": "Halving row 2 changes its first entry to 1, not zero.",
  "quizQ2QuestionTitle": "Row Swap (Permutation) Requirement",
  "quizQ2Prompt": "The pivot position (1,1) contains 0. Which row swap places a non-zero pivot at (1,1)?",
